00:09:32,048 --> 00:09:36,080
[Host] Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

74
00:09:36,679 --> 00:09:42,823
[Slow] HYBARIは、何を使って電気を作りますか。

75
00:09:43,624 --> 00:09:49,192
[Host] Hydrogen — a fuel cell reacts it with oxygen from the air to make electricity.

76
00:09:49,792 --> 00:09:55,864
[Slow] HYBARIは、走るときに何を出しませんか。

77
00:09:56,663 --> 00:10:00,864
[Host] Carbon dioxide — that's why it's seen as good for the environment.

78
