[Slow] HYBARIの営業運転は、いつごろ始まる予定ですか。

79
00:10:09,416 --> 00:10:15,943
[Host] Around the end of fiscal year 2027, on the Tsurumi Line and part of the Nambu Line.

80
00:10:16,543 --> 00:10:47,000
[Host] That's all for today. JR East says its HYBARI train, Japan's first hydrogen hybrid, will enter passenger service around the end of fiscal 2027 — combining a fuel cell and a battery, reacting hydrogen with oxygen to run with no carbon dioxide. It travels about seventy kilometers per fill, the plan was moved up from 2030, and a longer-range next-generation train is now in the works. Thanks for listening, and see you tomorrow.

81
00:10:47,600 --> 00:10:50,000
[News] また明日。
